{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52506","headline":"听《华严》诗（幷序） · 武则天","name":"听《华严》诗（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法席开广方，缁徒满胜筵。\n圣衆随云集，天华照日鲜。\n座分千叶华，香引六铢烟。\n钟声闻有顶，梵响韵无边。\n一音宣妙义，七处重弘宣。\n唯心明八会，涤虑体三禅。\n既悟无生灭，常欣佛现前。\n（《卐续藏经》本唐释法藏《华严经传记》卷三《智俨传》爲永昌元年作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52506.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52506","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}